# Copy this file to .env and fill in what you need. .env is gitignored — never commit it.
#
# Nothing in this lesson requires a key. The plugin is markdown skills, and the connect
# capability reads from an app you authorise in Claude itself, not from a key stored here.
#
# This file exists for the case where you extend the kit with something that does need one.
# Add one line per key: SERVICE_KEY=value. Never commit real values.
